            <ArticleTitle>Acute puerperal coital headache and hypertension.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>487-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>An unusual case of acute headache and hypertension occurring at the height of sexual excitement during the puerperium is presented. The patho-mechanism of this phenomenom is discussed and the literature reviewed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
